          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/5495696206363-How-to-allow-subscribers-to-opt-out-of-Mother-s-Day-Father-s-Day-and-other-holiday-messages#01GJ5KATXBJK1BQVYBC88AXR0X",
          "text": "Create a template with an opt-out button"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/5495696206363-How-to-allow-subscribers-to-opt-out-of-Mother-s-Day-Father-s-Day-and-other-holiday-messages#01GJ5KATXB98KD6TR36Z8DQDN7",
          "text": "Test the functionality and send a campaign"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/5495696206363-How-to-allow-subscribers-to-opt-out-of-Mother-s-Day-Father-s-Day-and-other-holiday-messages#01GJ5KATXBMP222JVXC40SWD5G",
          "text": "Create a segment and exclude it from holiday sends"
